<title>FINLAND: Tamro says Merita stake falls to 9.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Tamro says Merita stake falls to 9.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish pharmaceuticals wholesaler Oy Tamro Ab said on Tuesday banking group Merita Oy's holding in Tamro had fallen to 9.54 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;Merita group's holding is 9.54 percent of votes and shares,&quot; Tamro said in a statement.</p>
</text>
